ga8B(){return"What the service does"},
ga8A(){return"Gesher B1 connects families in Israel with caregivers, for permanent work or as a replacement. The family pays for time-limited access to contact details and to chats with caregivers"},
ga8v(){return"The service does not employ anyone and is not a party to the work agreement. The terms of the work and the payment for the care itself are agreed between the family and the caregiver"},
ga8t(){return"The service does not check or confirm caregivers\\x27 professional qualifications"},
